OL,3,GNEWSATown grants making 'huge
OL,4,Adifference' to traders
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrants aimed at helping independent
OL,7,Fbusinesses in Brackley attract more
OL,8,Fcustomers and improving the town centre
OL,9,Fare making a "huge difference", a
OL,10,Ftrader has said.
OL,12,FSince March, West Northamptonshire
OL,13,FCouncil has been offering help to
OL,14,Fbusinesses in the town.
OL,16,FThey can apply for grants of up to
OL,17,F#10,000 on a matched funding basis,
OL,18,Funder which the council will provide up
OL,19,Fto 80%.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
