OL,3,GNEWSATown grants making 'huge
OL,4,Adifference' to traders
OL,5,
OL,6,FRosie Crosbie, who runs Studio 8
OL,7,Fcreative space and was awarded money to
OL,8,Fpay for signage and furnishings, said:
OL,9,F"It's helped me take the next step in
OL,10,Fgrowing my business and creating
OL,11,Fsomething that I hope will become a
OL,12,Freal asset to the local community."
